surname>Vagero</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Kunst</surname><given-names>AE</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Estonia 1989&#x02013;2000: enormous increase in mortality differences by education</article-title><source>Int J Epidemiol</source><year>2003</year><volume>32</volume><fpage>1081</fpage><lpage>1087</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14681279</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1093/ije/dyg192</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Moskalewicz</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Simpura</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The supply of alcoholic beverages in transitional conditions: the case of Central and Eastern Europe</article-title><source>Addiction</source><year>2000</year><volume>95</volume><fpage>S505</fpage><lpage>522</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11218348</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1080/09652140020013746</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B15"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Prattala</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Helasoja</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name><name><surname>Finbalt</surname><given-names>g</given-names></name></person-group><person-group person-group-type="editor"><name><surname>McQueen D, Puska P</surname></name></person-group><article-title>Finbalt Health Monitor, Monitoring health behaviour in Finland and the Baltic countries</article-title><source>Global Behavioural Risk Factor Surveillance</source><year>2003</year><publisher-name>New York: Kluwer Academic/Plenum Publishers</publisher-name><fpage>57</fpage><lpage>72</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B16"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Helasoja</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name><name><surname>Lahelma</surname><given-names>